# vb1: ML leaves DOWN by a CARRIED puller: P' (-1,-1) facing up is pushed into (0,-1) by H' (-2,-1)
# together with the whole bottom row (BL, BM, BR ride right by one), pulls ML to (0,0), is pulled
# back to the corner, then U' (0,-2) pulls ML to (0,-1). C up 2 by the column-1 elevator, TL up,
# TM up then right, TR + MR right (QC). Close: RP (4,-1) pushes the bottom row back left.
